<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian companies ex-div to Dec 13.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian companies ex-div to Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of companies going ex-dividend over the next two weeks compiled from information supplied by the Australian Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Friday, December 6</p>
<p>St George Bank				 26.0  cents</p>
<p>Westpac Banking Corp		     24.38 cents</p>
<p>Monday, December 9</p>
<p>Arrowfield Group			    5.0  cents</p>
<p>Country Road				  6.06 cents</p>
<p>Macquarie Bank				 18.0  cents</p>
<p>Tuesday, December 10</p>
<p>Wesfi Ltd					 2.0  cents</p>
<p>Wednesday, December 11</p>
<p>Nil</p>
<p>Thursday, December 12</p>
<p>Harris Scarfe				   3.0  cents</p>
<p>Friday, December 13</p>
<p>Nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
